---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>

	<layout />

 <section class="about">
      <div class="hero">
        <img src="public/images/abouthero.webp" alt="KIND community">
        <h1>ABOUT<br>US</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="intro">
        <h2>BEHIND KIND</h2>
        <p>
          KIND DESIGN is a creative community
          built around the idea that great things
          happen when creative minds come together.
        </p>
        <p>
          We bring designers, thinkers, makers
          and curious people into the same space
          to connect, exchange ideas and inspire
          one another.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

   
    <section class="connections">
      <span class="eyebrow">CONNECTIONS</span>
      <div class="imggidmiddel">
      <img src="public/images/aboutgrid1.webp"
           alt="Creative community gathering">
      <img src="public/images/aboutgrid2.webp"
           alt="Disco ball at an event">
      <img class="imgnone" src="public/images/aboutgrid3.webp" alt="grid 3">
      <img class="imgnone" src="public/images/aboutgrid4.webp" alt="grid 4">
        </div>
      <p class="photo-caption">GOOD VIBES</p>
    </section>

  
    <section class="events">
      <span class="eyebrow">CREATIVITY</span>
      <h2>WE'RE HOSTING<br>EVENTS</h2>
      <p>
       Our events are designed to bring creative people together in ways that feel natural, inspiring and genuinely enjoyable. From intimate talks and hands-on workshops to casual meetups and shared creative experiences, we create opportunities to learn from each other and explore new perspectives.
      </p>
      <div class="pilbutton">
        <img src="public/images/Skærmbillede 2026-11-17 kl. 17.43.31_result.webp" alt="pil">
      <a href="../events" class="event-button">Events</a>
</div>
      <img src="public/images/about2.webp"
           alt="People enjoying a creative event">

      <div class="blue-text">
        <p>
          We're here to make the creative world
          feel more connected, more open and
          a little less predictable.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe creativity grows when
          people challenge each other, share
          what they've learned and step
          outside their usual circles.
        </p>
        <p>We're a mix of people who think in colours, obsess over typography, notice the smallest details and somehow always end up talking about design.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

   
<section class="vision">
      <span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</span>
      <h2>OUR VISION</h2>
    <div class="gridvision">
        <div class="visiontext">
      <p>
       Our vision is to bring creative people closer together. In an industry where so much of our work happens individually, behind screens and within our own creative circles, we want to create more opportunities to meet, connect and grow together.
      </p>
      <p>
       KIND DESIGN is about building a community where knowledge moves freely, ideas are exchanged openly and everyone has something valuable to contribute. 
      </p>
      <p>
     Through talks, workshops, events and everyday conversations, we aim to make inspiration more accessible and meaningful connections easier to find.
      </p>
      </div>
      <img class="bottomimg" src="public/images/about3.webp"
           alt="Members of KIND DESIGN">
    </div>
</section>
 </Layout>
 <style>
    img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

h1, h2 {
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.05;
  font-family: 'headline', sans-serif;
  font-size: 50px;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 30px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

p {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  font-family: 'p_thin', sans-serif;
}

.eyebrow {
  display: block;
  color: var(--pink);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
   font-family: 'headline', sans-serif;
}



.hero {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0;
}

.hero img {
  width: 70%;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.hero h1 {
  color: var(--pink);
  font-size: 50px
  margin-top: 30px;
  margin-left: -30px;
  position: relative;
}

.intro {
  padding: 55px 24px 45px;
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.intro h2 {
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}



.connections {
  background: #c8e9f5;
  padding-top: 10px;
}

.connections .eyebrow {
  padding-left: 8px;
}

.connections img {
  width: 100%;
}

.photo-caption {
  text-align: right;
  font-size: 10px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 6px 10px;
}



.events {
  padding-top: 40px;
}

.events > .eyebrow,
.events > h2,
.events > p {
  margin-left: 24px;
  margin-right: 24px;
}

.event-button  {
   background-color: var(--pink);
  color: var(--black);
  padding: 8px 25px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 14px;

  width: fit-content;
  height: fit-content;
 border-radius: 30px;
    border: 6px solid var(--silver);
  justify-self: center;
  align-self: center;
	margin-top: 40px;
}

.events > img {
  width: 100%;
}

.blue-text {
  background: #c8e9f5;
  padding: 25px 20px;
}

.blue-text p:nth-child(2) {
  text-align: right;
}

.pilbutton{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    img{
height: 100%;    }
}


.vision {
  padding-top: 55px;
}

.vision .eyebrow,
.vision h2,
.vision p {
  margin-left: 24px;
  margin-right: 24px;
   
}

.vision h2 {
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.vision p {
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.vision img {
  margin-top: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.imgnone{
    display: none;
}
